        {
            "id": "a003_048_0008",
            "en_US": [
                "I am not as good an artist as Burgh,\n",
                "but I have a liking for paintings.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Let me see. Today, I'd like to paint\n",
                "{VAR 0103 0000}-type Pokémon!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Will you show me what kinds of Pokémon\n",
                "you have?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0009",
            "en_US": [
                "Please show me a Pokémon that's\n",
                "{VAR 0103 0000} type!{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0010",
            "en_US": [
                "Oh! You have that type!\n",
                "I'm inspired!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Thank you! As a token of my gratitude,\n",
                "which one would you like?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0011",
            "en_US": "Cheri Berry",
