        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0017",
            "en_US": [
                "Aww. You are the best!\n",
                "Please come back tomorrow, too!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0018",
            "en_US": [
                "As long as the artist enjoys creating\n",
                "an artwork, it doesn't matter if the{VAR BE00}\n",
                "result is judged as bad or good."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0019",
            "en_US": [
                "If you catch a Pokémon that's\n",
                "{VAR 0103 0000} type, please show it to me!{VAR BE00}\n",
