            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0020",
            "en_US": [
                "The Pokémon you chose is not the one\n",
                "I requested.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "What I want to paint is a Pokémon that's\n",
                "{VAR 0103 0000} type!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_048_0021",
            "en_US": [
                "Oh!\n",
                "The shape of this Egg...{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Superb! It gives me chills!\n",
                "It's electrifying! It makes me tremble!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Alas, even I cannot tell what type\n",
